@startuml
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam wrapWidth 320
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #1E293B
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam noteBorderColor #64748B
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam legendFontSize 12
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontSize 13
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  DiamondBorderColor #B45309
  DiamondFontSize 12
}
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 15
  TitleFontStyle bold
  BorderColor #64748B
}
title Ideator — workflow (activity diagram, designed workflow, 2026-11-10)

|#FFFFFF|User (Ronni)|
start
:Send message;
|#F8FAFC|Ideator|
if (Problem statement given?) then (no)
  :Greeting: intro + "Tip: give me a problem statement."
  Run knobs list (shown values are defaults),
  template as full URL, pretotype note, example problem;
  |User (Ronni)|
  :Send problem statement;
  |Ideator|
else (yes)
endif
:Parse 8 knobs (missing = default, never asked):
ideas 5 | pretotypes 4 | sources 5 | country United States*
language = message language / English | format = sheet
mode = saved, else auto | template = Ideator Template URL, id/URL or none
(* only if statement + research point nowhere else; never from memory)
Only mode is saved, record run_started with seconds,
no opening message;

|Ideator|
:<b>DISCOVER</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  |#EEF6FF|Web / research sources|
  :Customer complaints, reviews, forums / Reddit,
  articles, competitors — country market;
  |Ideator|
  :Cite <sources> distinct sources (ID, URL, summary + limitations);
  :Challenges C1..C10, each cited or "hypothesis, no evidence found";
  :Sticky note per challenge, save to run JSON;

|Ideator|
:<b>DEFINE</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  :Possible 1-5 + Exciting 1-5 -> Score, rank;
  :Propose top 5 (ties: higher Exciting, then Possible, then ID);
  if (mode?) then (ask)
    |User (Ronni)|
    :PAUSE: choose / steer challenges; <<#FFF3C4>>
    |Ideator|
  else (auto)
    :Auto-pick top 5, write pick + reason in sheet;
  endif
  :Save ratings + picks to JSON;

|Ideator|
:<b>DEVELOP</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  :<ideas> ideas per picked challenge (C4-I1 ...),
  fitted to country's culture, habits and rules, save to JSON;

|Ideator|
:<b>DELIVER</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  :Cheap + Simple (1-5 each) -> base 2-10;
  :x evidence: strong 1.3 / some 1.15 / none 1.0 (hypothesis)
  x uniqueness: non-obvious 1.2 / somewhat 1.1 / obvious 1.0
  weighted score, rounded half up to 1 decimal;
  :Top 5, tie-break evidence > uniqueness > Simple > Cheap;
  if (still tied?) then (yes)
    :Lowest ID first, mark
    "unresolved tie, order arbitrary";
  else (no)
  endif
  :Pick reasons + weighting notes, mix ideas into concepts,
  rank by avg weighted score (ties: avg evidence, more ideas);
  if (mode?) then (ask)
    |User (Ronni)|
    :PAUSE: review ideas + concepts,
    choose concepts to pretotype; <<#FFF3C4>>
    |Ideator|
  else (auto)
    :Auto-pick top 5 ideas + top 2 concepts;
  endif
  :Save to JSON;

|Ideator|
:<b>PRETOTYPES</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  :<pretotypes> tests across picked concepts, best first:
  hypothesis, success number, deadline, testable line, go / no-go,
  one recommended first test per concept;
  :Draft materials for recommended tests
  (country language + report language), never send / post;
  if (mode?) then (ask)
    |User (Ronni)|
    :PAUSE: which tests run, and start dates?; <<#FFF3C4>>
    |Ideator|
  else (auto)
    :Recommended first tests = selected,
    check-in status: "set up when you give a start date";
  endif
  :Save to JSON, set run_stopped (with seconds);

|Ideator|
:<b>REPORT BUILD — BUILD LOCALLY, UPLOAD ONCE</b>; <<#CBD5E1>>
  if (template knob?) then (set)
    |#E0F2FE|Google Drive connector|
    :export_file template as xlsx, once
    (template is read-only, never modified);
    |#F0FDF4|sheet_builder.py (local)|
    :sheet_builder.py run.json --template template-export.xlsx;
    :Template's own tabs first, in template order,
    read-only (fingerprint assert: cells, styles,
    row heights, widths, images, freeze, filters);
    :15 report tabs built from scratch: same-named
    tab replaced in place, missing tabs appended;
  else (none)
    |sheet_builder.py (local)|
    :sheet_builder.py run.json
    (15 report tabs from scratch);
  endif
  |sheet_builder.py (local)|
  :Sheet rules on report tabs:
  15 tabs in order, header on row 1, no branding,
  green #A8E6A3 + bold selected rows, top-aligned wrapped text,
  text columns auto-width, max 42 units (~300 px),
  no fixed row heights, frozen header + filters,
  ID sort key, Source column except Tab guide,
  Problem: Run started / Run stopped / Run time;
  |Google Drive connector|
  :ONE create_file: xlsx -> native Google Sheet
  titled <problem>-YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM (never "Copy of");
  :get_file_metadata (native, run name,
  rename copy with update_file if needed);
  :get_file_permissions: owner only, never shared;
  :One export_file (xlsx) of the new sheet;
  |Ideator|
  :Compare locally with <name>.xlsx,
  fix real mismatches only;

|User (Ronni)|
:Final chat delivery (one message):
problem verbatim, Run knobs (8 lines),
"Here is the result.", sheet-name link;

if (Start date given later?) then (yes)
  |#FDF4FF|Routine scheduler|
  :One-time routine per selected test,
  fires the day after its deadline;
  |Ideator|
  :Ask results, compare with success number,
  recommend go / no-go / iterate;
  :Update JSON, rebuild, upload NEW sheet
  (update time), say which is current;
  |Routine scheduler|
  :Delete spent routine;
else (no)
endif
|User (Ronni)|
stop

note right
  Cancel at any time: stop all work,
  Problem "Cancelled" = CANCELLED in a
  rebuilt + newly uploaded sheet,
  delete follow-up routine.
  Never delete anything on Drive.
end note
@enduml
